            "acceptance": "accepted so far: about 4057 at 13:58Z (Reuters, context) and 4050.95 at 15:05Z, below every earlier price on record today (4080-4104, 09:00-10:20Z); the exact T0 level is not observed, and on 6 Nov the reaction also held at T0+30 min and T0+2 h before closing back through the pre-release level, so acceptance at T0+95 min does not separate today from 6 Nov.",
