            },
            "confirmations": "(1) BLS core CPI +0.3% m/m against 0.2% consensus; (2) the captured -2.13% with every USD pair USD-up and the break of the 9 Nov D1 low 4054.825; (3) crowded speculative length (45% of open interest net long, 3 Nov).",
            "driver": "MIXED inside sessions, CLEAR in D1 sign.; D1 sign followed the USD leg on 4 Nov (+3.23% with EURUSD +0.25%), 6 Nov (-0.36% with -0.79%), 9 Nov (+2.06% with +0.68%) and today (-2.13% with -0.37%); but today's move is about 5.8 times the USD leg, about -1.20% of it came by 09:30Z with EURUSD +0.08%, and the 6 Nov release session went +0.20% against DXY +0.23%; 20-day DXY beta -1.17 (correlation -0.22), 20-day US10Y correlation +0.09.",
